      <p begin="02:16.750" end="02:19.080" ttm:agent="v1">Say you want love, boy, I know what that means</p>
      <p begin="02:19.080" end="02:21.390" ttm:agent="v1">Make you feel way better than in your dreams</p>
      <p begin="02:21.390" end="02:23.550" ttm:agent="v1">If I show you that I know where it's at</p>
      <p begin="02:23.550" end="02:25.050" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, would you like that?</p>
