      <p begin="02:26.110" end="02:28.430" ttm:agent="v1">If I come close, baby, would you like that?</p>
      <p begin="02:28.430" end="02:30.710" ttm:agent="v1">If I give some, would you give it right back?</p>
      <p begin="02:30.710" end="02:33.160" ttm:agent="v1">If I show you that I know where it's at</p>
      <p begin="02:33.160" end="02:34.660" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, would you like that?</p>
